        question: "**Sophie Rooney**\nIn 2016, Sophie Rooney set off with the bold intention of becoming the first woman to run the length of Scandinavia – 3,000 km in 103 days! Initially accompanied by a fellow trail runner, Sophie carried everything she needed on her back, with bears being top of her worries. However, she soon found that these big grizzly creatures were the least of her concerns. In the first month alone, she had to battle extreme tiredness, dehydration, hunger and eventually illness. However, not willing to give in Sophie pushed on, often against the advice she received from people back home.\n**This explorer ___________________.**",
