        type: "single",
        question: "**Calum Muskett**\nA professional climber, mountain instructor and writer, 22-year-old Calum Muskett has climbed big walls and mountains across the world. He grew up on the very edge of the Carneddau mountain range, which hugely influenced his development as a climber and his love of mountain sports. Since his first outings, Calum has travelled all over the world free climbing, only using simple ropes for protection. He is a well published outdoor writer with feature articles published by the biggest climbing magazines. Calum is also a British Mountain Guide and holds the UK’s Winter Mountaineering and Climbing Instructor qualification – the two highest mountaineering qualifications in the UK.\n**This explorer ___________________.**",
