        id: "eng-674-11",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Unusual Restaurants**\n**Dans Le Noir, London**\nIt’s a novel concept where diners are served meals in complete darkness. Visitors must rely on their server for everything. Guests are guided to the table by the waiters armed with night view binoculars. Then the waiters take customers’ dietary preferences, and after that the idea is to lose all control over one’s meal and give oneself over to just experiencing it. This concept restaurant currently has branches in nine cities around the world.\n**This restaurant ________.**",
