        type: "single",
        question: "**Take-Out Pop-Up Restaurant, Singapore**\nA custom mobile shipping container restaurant has launched a world tour, leaving its home of Singapore to places like London, Paris, New York, Dubai and Sydney. The 20-foot used shipping container opens to display a mouth-watering assortment of Singaporean foods, and will also be used as a demonstration kitchen to show off Singapore’s culinary talent and food brands.\n**This restaurant ________.**",
