        type: "single",
        question: "**House of Fraser Oxford Street**\nHome-grown fashion labels such as Barbour and Biba sit alongside international brands including Calvin Klein, Ralph Lauren and Ted Baker, at this central London department store. You’ll also find plenty of beauty products and a wide range of stunning furniture, curtains as well as the latest household goods at House of Fraser Oxford Street. Take a break in the charming Tea Terrace on the fifth floor where you can try a traditional British breakfast or afternoon tea.\n**Which shop _______________?**",
