        id: "eng-370-32",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Yumenoshima Tropical Greenhouse Dome, Tokyo**\nThis large greenhouse complex in Tokyo was originally built on land reclaimed from a site used for waste depositing. There are actually three domes and an additional exhibit space where rare species of carnivorous plants are housed. Highlights include a fern forest, an indoor waterfall, orchid gardens from the sub-tropical Ogasawara Islands.\n**Which place ________?**",
