        id: "eng-351-27",
        type: "single",
        question: "**New Year Traditions**\nIn the Czech Republic, fireworks light up the sky. In Prague, visitors can watch fantastic fireworks on the world-famous Charles Bridge after the clock strikes midnight. All across the country, people gather in pubs, clubs, and city squares to celebrate New Year.\n**Where do people ________?**",
