        id: "eng-255-1",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Top Family Places to Visit**\nDo you have trouble finding something to do that the whole family can enjoy? Don’t worry! These activities make perfect family outings for those weekends when you and your family need to get out of the house. In good weather or bad, you’re bound to find something to satisfy everybody.\n(1) ______\nTake the whole family on a trip. Visit each creature’s exhibit and test your family’s knowledge of animals. Little kids love to stop by the fence to mingle with a variety of friendly, furry animals. Older kids will enjoy learning about the various environments and eating habits of animals.",
