        id: "eng-199-2",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A-H) to (1-5). There are three choices you do not need to use. Write your answers on the separate answer sheet.**\n**How to Get Motivated to Study**\n**____________**\nMake sure you have all the pens, pencils, paper, and highlighters you need. You don’t\nwant to interrupt your study time to get more. People are more productive when\nthey’re hydrated. Small snacks like peanuts or fruit will help keep you energized.",
