        type: "single",
        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A–H) to (1–5). There are three choices you do not need to use. Write your answers on the separate answer sheet. **\n**The 5 Browns**\nPiano virtuosos Desirae, Deondra, Gregory, Melody, and Ryan Brown charm audiences worldwide, bringing fresh energy to the classical music genre. They sat down with two teen pianists to discuss the challenges of studying music.\n**5 ________**\nDeondra: Just be yourself and don’t worry if you hit a few wrong notes. It’s not the end of\nthe world. And don’t be afraid of the audience. They’re there to enjoy the music; they’re\nnot there to pick it all apart like we often think. So, just try to give them a good time.",
