        id: "eng-149-1",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A-H) to (1-5). There are three choices you do not need to use.**\n**Top Five Study Tips**\n**1.__________.** Make sure you have all the materials you need at hand before you start studying. Getting up to look for a pencil sharpener or ruler will break your concentration and waste your time.",
