        id: "eng-149-3",
        type: "single",
        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A-H) to (1-5). There are three choices you do not need to use.**\n**Top Five Study Tips**\n**3._____________.** Use a calendar or a list of dates or a wall planner to keep track of exam dates and assignment due dates. Space out your study time each week for the whole term/semester - don't try to cram it all in the night before! Do the hardest work when you're feeling your best. Save the easy stuff for when you're tired. Set yourself a time limit for each task and follow it.",
