        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A-H) to (1-5). There are three choices you do not need to use.**\n**Top Five Study Tips**\n**5.____________.** Taking detailed notes in class or at home will save you a lot of time later. Re-writing and adding to your notes is a great way to revise what you've learned.",
