        question: "**Read the texts below. Match choices (A–H) to (11–15). There are three choices you do not need to use.**\n13 ______\nThis camp is for teens and adults who want to become more effective and efficient in the water sports. Once there, you’ll find stunning scenery and first-class paddling. But first of all the camp will focus on the rafting. With the onset of the spring snowmelt, the area serves up prime-time whitewater rafting. Rafters flock to two rivers in particularhe forest-hemmed Skykomish and the wide-open, sun-drenched Wenatchee. Both offer rollicking fun for participants of all skill levels. Campers will be offered tours on both rivers. Welcome to aquatic nirvana!",
